			<Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX3503">
				<Properties>
					<string name="Name">Description</string>
					<string name="Value">Looks talkative! Move closer, perhaps you can talk!</string>
					<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
				</Properties>
			</Item>
			<Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX3504">
				<Properties>
					<string name="Name">Talk</string>
					<string name="Value">Hello! How may I help you? (a. What is Builderman Suite Hotel? b. What can I do here? c. How do I get a room? d. What services do you offer?  e. What are the rumours? h. How To guide f. Nothing now)</string>
					<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
				</Properties>
				<Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX3505">
					<Properties>
						<string name="Name">a</string>
						<string name="Value">Builderman Suite Hotel is an amazing hotel dedicated to Builderman himself. Located in Robloxia, Builderman&apos;s Suite Hotel is a luxurious place to relax and have fun! Builderman&apos;s Suite Hotel was founded in 2008.</string>
						<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
					</Properties>
				</Item>
				<Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX3506">
					<Properties>
						<string name="Name">b</string>
						<string name="Value">Other than our services, you can mop floors, do gardening work, clean windows and bathrooms, or even do some cooking! You can also book a room!</string>
						<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
					</Properties>
				</Item>
				<Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX3507">
					<Properties>
						<string name="Name">c</string>
						<string name="Value">First you&apos;ll need some money. Then, go to the other desk across the room and talk to the staff there. Finally, you may use the elevators to go to your floor! Your key will unlock the door, and you&apos;ll be in! The room # is represented by the floor its on, whether it&apos;s on the midfloor or not, and finally which room number on that floor it is.</string>
						<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
					</Properties>
				</Item>
				<Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX3508">
					<Properties>
						<string name="Name">d</string>
						<string name="Value">We offer many services, including a gym, pool, elevators, this help desk, a restaurant and cafe, many rooms, a recreation room, and the time of your life! You can have lots of fun and explore!</string>
						<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
					</Properties>
				</Item>
				<Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX3509">
					<Properties>
						<string name="Name">e</string>
						<string name="Value">Rumours? Well... there have been a few rumours suggesting various secrets, such as secret keys and doors, but I honestly doubt there&apos;s anything of the sort. However, there has been some evidence to the rumour about the 10 missing orbs, but I can&apos;t tell you much more than that!</string>
						<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
					</Properties>
				</Item>
				<Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX3510">
					<Properties>
						<string name="Name">f</string>
						<string name="Value">Enjoy your stay at Builderman Suite Hotel!</string>
						<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
					</Properties>
				</Item>
				<Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX3511">
					<Properties>
						<string name="Name">h</string>
						<string name="Value">There&apos;s a variety of things I can help you with... (a. Cleaning b. Gardening c. Cooking)</string>
						<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
					</Properties>
					<Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX3512">
						<Properties>
							<string name="Name">a</string>
							<string name="Value">The cleaning tools are fairly simple to use. Get one or two from a storage room and click on what they clean. You may need to click multiple times. You will get money for your services! Note that you need to be close enough to the object you are cleaning to clean it!</string>
							<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
						</Properties>
					</Item>
					<Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX3513">
						<Properties>
							<string name="Name">b</string>
							<string name="Value">Gardening works fairly simply: get the watering can and weed tool from a storage room, and proceed to water the garden as needed. The flowers will grow, but you need to weed the garden or else the weeds will kill the surrounding flowers! You will get paid well for weeding and watering.</string>
							<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
						</Properties>
					</Item>
					<Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX3514">
						<Properties>
							<string name="Name">c</string>
							<string name="Value">What part of cooking? a. Overview b. Basics c. Making food</string>
							<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
						</Properties>
						<Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX3515">
							<Properties>
								<string name="Name">a</string>
								<string name="Value">OVERVIEW: Cooking, done in the cafe on the 3rd floor, is a very wonderful job at Builderman Suite Hotel! You must click on different tools to access different ingrediants and actions. You also need to be close to the object to access stuff from that object (ex. Shelf). The orders are of the 4 tables -- examine them to find out what you need to make!</string>
								<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
							</Properties>
						</Item>
						<Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX3516">
							<Properties>
								<string name="Name">b</string>
								<string name="Value">BASICS: Many tools are for navigation. &quot;...&quot; is navigation; everything else either moves things (the Hand in Select...) or makes something (selecting bread, for example). You need to GET the object before you can SELECT and use it, and you can only carry 4 objects at a time. After that, you will need to PUT them BACK.</string>
								<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
							</Properties>
						</Item>
						<Item class="StringValue" referent="RBX3517">
							<Properties>
								<string name="Name">c</string>
								<string name="Value">For sandwiches and hamburgers, start with the bread and add lettuce, cheese, and meat. For hamburgers, add ketchup and mustard. Cook it by GET... STOVE and click on it! It will shine a bright colour when it&apos;s done. All drinks you just click to make them, and the soup and fries you need to cook.</string>
								<bool name="archivable">true</bool>
							</Properties>
						</Item>
					</Item>
				</Item>
			</Item>
		</Item>
